  "description": "Married off to the Domine family like a commodity, Amelia lives a loveless and dreary marriage. Unbeknownst to her, she was manipulated into spying on her own husband, ultimately meeting a tragic demise. Given a second chance at life, Amelia is determined not to repeat the same foolish existence. She makes an offer to Count Domine.\n\n *“I will help you win this war.”\n“And what do you seek in return?”\n“When everything is over… divorce me.”\n“How come?”\n“Where neither love is given nor received, why stay in such a marriage?”*\n\nHandshakes were exchanged, and with each passing step, Amelia drew closer to her liberation. But this man... was he always this sweet?\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)\n\n*Note: First released in English, with the initial eligible release in Japanese followed by Korean, making it a manga by our standards.*",
